    "title": "Dr Farhan Vakani receives Hubert Humphrey Fellowship Award",
    "subtitle": null,
    "summary": "Assistant Manager, Department of Continuing Professional Education, has been nominated for Hubert H. Humphrey Fellowship Award 2014-15.   ",
    "media": [
      {
        "_uid": "fae22cec510d54c7",
